        "content": "**Sensor events are only generated for these ports (T-Pot on 192.168.1.28, verified 2026-10-15):**\n\n| Sensor | Ports |\n|---|---|\n| Cowrie (SSH/telnet) | 22, 23 |\n| Dionaea | 21, 135, 445, 1433, 1723, 1883, 3306, 27017, 42, 69/udp, 81 |\n| Mailoney | 25, 587 |\n| Heralding | 110, 143, 465, 993, 995, 1080, 5432, 5900 |\n| Snare/Tanner, Wordpot, H0neytr4p, Honeyaml | 80, 8080, 443, 3000 |\n| Elasticpot, Redishoneypot, IPPhoney, Miniprint | 9200, 6379, 631, 9100 |\n| Conpot, SentryPeer | 1025, 10001, 50100, 5060 |\n| Honeytrap | any TCP port not otherwise handled |\n\nNot covered (RST, Suricata only): 3389/RDP and other ports T-Pot's firewall accepts but nothing serves. Admin ports 64295 (SSH) and 64297 (web UI) are the Pi's own.\nLocal changes that make these LAN-visible: `docs/tpot-honeypot/local-changes.md`."
